      "content": "TRING RURAL            WINGRAVE ROAD SP 91 SW                                         (West side)                                         Gubblecote 2/157                                   Gubblecote Cross - -                                       II House. C17, N extension later C20. Timber frame roughcast with steep thatched roof with scalloped ridge, half-hipped at E end. Matching plastered brick N wing with thatched roof half-hipped to N.  A 1 1/2 storeys, 3 cells plan, internal chimney house, probably designed with a lobby entrance on N but now facing S with recessed entrance in N wing. Large internal chimney in front roofslope 1/3 from W end.  1 swept dormer with 2-light casements, at the eaves both to E of chimney. 3 casement windows to ground floor. Internal chimney has 3 flues, single flue to large external E gable kitchen chimney. C19 internal small W gable chimney. 1½ storeys N extension has 2 similar swept dormers on E but broad N gable with 2 windows on each floor and central door reached by bridge over stream. Listing NGR: SP9047115102"
    }
  ],
